# The engine-default WORLD-TEXT font page: the committed engine font (Nunito,
# SIL OFL) baked at boot into ONE in-memory GPU page by engine_gui/FontAtlas
# and SHARED by every WorldTextComponent (floating labels / damage numbers /
# name tags in the 3D scene). Like gui_ttf_demo.ogui it carries NO [Texture]
# file - the page is generated at the display's content scale. A single face
# (index 0) at a generous design size keeps world text crisp when scaled up.
[Texture]
page 1024

[Font.0]
name world
ttf Nunito-Regular.ttf
size 48
